   "kind": "text-images-slider",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior design",
   "intro": "The Antares 8 Fishing is far more sporty in style than the Antares 8 Cruising and boasts dedicated equipment for fishers. Its modular cockpit makes movement easier and every detail has been optimised.\nThe aft bench has been replaced by a fishing station with professional-grade rod holders. In addition to the water circulation live bait well, there are three storage compartments under the deck, one of which can hold a fish box.\nA major new feature is the side access gate to starboard, making mooring manoeuvres easier and also making it easier to lift larger catches on board.",
